  "description": "MEYKOU crystallizes in the orthorhombic crystal system with space group P b c a. Reported CIF formula moiety: C34 H64 Gd4 N4 O24,2(C1 H4 O1). From the CIF bond table, Gd1 (Gd) has 7 O neighbors; Gd2 (Gd) has 8 O neighbors; Gd1D (Gd) has 7 O neighbors; Gd2D (Gd) has 8 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 5 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.439-3.920 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 85.01-112.84°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Gd4(CH3COO)6(H3L)2]·2CH3OH. Article name explicitly identifies I(II).",
